```js
class Counter {
  #count;                                  // private: only this class can touch it.
  constructor(start = 0) {
    if (!Number.isInteger(start) || start < 0) throw new RangeError("start must be >= 0");
    this.#count = start;
  }
  get value() { return this.#count; }        // read-only view.
  increment() { this.#count += 1; }
  decrement() {
    if (this.#count === 0) throw new RangeError("already at 0");
    this.#count -= 1;
  }
}

const attempts = new Counter(2);
attempts.decrement();   // value 1
attempts.decrement();   // value 0
attempts.decrement();   // RangeError, value stays 0
```

| Piece | Job |
|---|---|
| constructor. | validate and set starting state. |
| `#count`. | hidden state no outsider can write. |
| getter `value`. | lets others read without writing. |
| methods. | the only doors that change state, each checks the rule. |

